{
  "_comment": [
    "TEMPORARY phase-2 instrumentation — not a project setting to keep.",
    "Install with:  cp tools/capture/settings.capture.json .claude/settings.json",
    "Remove with:   rm .claude/settings.json",
    "",
    "Captures the raw payload of every hook event relevant to the traffic",
    "light state model, so docs/protocol.md §8's best-effort mapping table",
    "can be replaced with one validated against reality.",
    "",
    "Payloads land in capture/raw.jsonl (gitignored — they contain real",
    "prompts, file paths and code, which PRD §9 keeps out of this repo).",
    "",
    "The capture script always exits 0 and never writes to stdout/stderr,",
    "so a failure here can never block or disturb a Claude Code session."
  ],
